Bootstrap: docker
From: python:3.11-slim

%labels
    Author marco.soldani
    Purpose "Jupyter + FairMind deps per il benchmark causal fairness"

%post
    apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \
        git build-essential && \
    rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*

    pip install --no-cache-cdir \
        jupyterlab \
        pandas \
        pgmpy \
        networkx \
        loguru \
        openai \
        matplotlib \
        tqdm ipywidgets

%help
    Ambiente per lanciare i notebook di benchmark su Thor.

    Build (sul login node, una tantum):
        apptainer build jupyter_env.sif jupyter_env.def

    Esecuzione del notebook in modalità automatica:
        apptainer exec jupyter_env.sif \
            jupyter nbconvert --to notebook --execute \
            --output benchmark_output.ipynb \
            2_1_benchmark_thor.ipynb
